                    <p class="text-blue-800 font-medium">🎯 Learning Focus: ADC, analog sensors, and data processing</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Learning Objectives -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
                <h2 style="color: #667eea; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem;">📚 Learning Objectives</h2>
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                    <div>
                        <h3 style="color: #2d3748; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center;">By the end of this week, you will:</h3>
                        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.8;">
